<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46835" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡλιαία</span></b> , ἡ, at Athens,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>public place</i> or
				<i>hall</i>, in which the chief law-court was held, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ἡλιαίᾳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					897
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναβὰς εἰς τὴν ἡ. τὴν τῶν
				θεσμοθετῶν</span> prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Antipho
				6.21
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12.39.75
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				63.14
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>supreme court</i> at Athens, Lex Solonis ap. <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				10.16
			</span></i>, Lex ap.<i><span class="en">
				D.
				21.47
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				1.28.8
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁλία</span>
			 (A) (q.v.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡλιαίη,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλέα</span>
			 (B), <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
